        "TileImage": "$($repository 2b64e6b0-8192-4815-9bd9-f3dbc599ac11).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47, and welcome back to Sapienza, Italy. Theres this guy coming to Sapienza tomorrow evening who has just purchased a really old antique item that our client wants to get his hands on. He says it contains something that shouldnt be in his hands. This item was first owned by our first target, Torres Piombo. Then we have the person who transported the item to Sapienza, Ennio Bruno. And last but certainly not least, we have the researcher of the item, Dr. Oscar Lafayette. Have fun!",
